224938678", "author": {"steamid": "76561198058228870", "personaname": "Drago ุ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/LordDrago96/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 75, "playtime_forever": 4209, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 180, "last_played": 1779383321, "avatar": "3e10acc033d8c3594dfc889d23e96fdbec1cf06d"}, "language": "english", "review": "3/3", "timestamp_created": 1778127076, "timestamp_updated": 1778127076, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "224863502", "author": {"steamid": "76561198255260695", "personaname": "Porphy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Porphyrian/", "num_games_owned": 160, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 13990, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13919, "last_played": 1781678396, "avatar": "ea79366111fe0b12781b63c556b5a1a61469a146"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've 100%'d this game and would do it again. it's peak", "timestamp_created": 1778027108, "timestamp_updated": 1778027108, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "224857308", "author": {"steamid": "76561198069135958", "personaname": "Roe Jogan", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Jillbutt69/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 136, "playtime_forever": 868, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 868, "last_played": 1749508073, "avatar": "cde34570ee8d76077db475cf292a9a0161d68c7c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Remnant 2 does something that most souls-likes don't bother attempting which is making the punishment feel fair rather than personal. Gunfire Games took what worked in the first game and built something with enough variety in its world generation and build diversity that two people comparing notes on their playthroughs can sound like they played completely different games, because in a lot of ways they did.\n\nThe guns are the hook for people who bounce off traditional souls-likes. Having range changes the calculus of every encounter in ways that open up the combat to a different kind of player, someone who can read spacing and timing but maybe doesn't have the muscle memory for parrying and dodging at melee distance. It's still punishing. Just punishing in a more approachable dialect.\n\nThe world design is genuinely ambitious. Each biome has its own visual identity and lore that goes deep enough to reward curiosity without demanding it, and the randomized elements keep return visits feeling fresh in ways that straightforward level design can't replicate.\n\nNot finishing it is a completely valid place to land with a game this long and this difficult. Enjoying what it's doing without forcing yourself through content that isn't landing is honestly the right instinct. Some games are worth playing without being worth completing and Remnant 2 has enough going on in its first half to justify the price of admission regardless of whether you see the credits.\n\nGunfire Games has quietly built one of the more interesting studios working in this space and the jump in quality from the first Remnant to this one suggests they're only getting started.", "timestamp_created": 1778018912, "timestamp_updated": 1778018912, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.478862971067428589", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}]}